Package: craftos-desktop
Version: 0.1
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: nu-stats <j.stowell@northeastern.edu>
Depends: r-base, python3
Recommends: statcraft, rcraft, qualcraft, egocraft, mapcraft, husky-eye-view, mergecraft, husky-explorer, heic-converter, craft-keys
Description: CraftOS desktop metapackage
 Pulls in the ArtCraft office apps (wordcraft, gridcraft, deckcraft, pdfcraft),
 the nu-stats Craft research apps, and the shared toolchain they need, and
 ships the CraftOS wallpapers. App .debs found at build time become hard
 Depends; apps without a release stay in Recommends until they have one.
